---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EditorialImage from '../../components/EditorialImage.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../../components/ButtonLink.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="宜蘭・竹屋">
  <article class="project-detail">
    <header class="project-hero page-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">RESIDENTIAL・YILAN・2025</p>
      <h1>宜蘭・竹屋</h1><p class="project-english">Bamboo House, Yilan</p>
      <div class="project-summary"><p>我們把房子視為一只盛接光線的器皿。讓竹、灰泥與舊木安靜地留在空間裡，不刻意做舊，也不急著變新。</p><dl><div><dt>年份</dt><dd>2025</dd></div><div><dt>地點</dt><dd>宜蘭・員山</dd></div><div><dt>坪數</dt><dd>48 坪</dd></div><div><dt>用途</dt><dd>私人住宅</dd></div></dl></div>
    </header>
    <div class="project-cover page-shell-wide"><EditorialImage label="BAMBOO HOUSE / LIVING ROOM" tone="bamboo" ratio="16 / 9" /></div>
    <section class="project-concept page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">01・CONCEPT</p><h2>以一片竹影，<br />劃分一天的時間。</h2><div><p>屋主期待的不是空無一物的極簡，而是一處能讓日常痕跡被溫柔接住的家。我們保留原有結構，重新安排採光、收納與家人交會的路徑。</p><p>材料刻意不求一致：粗糙灰泥映著柔光，竹編拉門將風帶進室內，老木桌留下每一頓飯的記憶。</p></div></section>
    <section class="project-gallery page-shell-wide">
      <EditorialImage label="MORNING LIGHT / EAST WINDOW" tone="morning" ratio="5 / 6" />
      <EditorialImage label="DINING / OLD WOOD" tone="wood" ratio="5 / 3.4" />
      <EditorialImage label="TEA ROOM / BAMBOO SCREEN" tone="tea" ratio="4 / 5" />
      <EditorialImage label="MATERIAL DETAIL / LIME PLASTER" tone="stone" ratio="4 / 3" />
    </section>
    <section class="material-section page-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">02・MATERIALS</p><h2>會呼吸，也會變老的材料</h2></div><ul><li><span>01</span>宜蘭桂竹・手工編織</li><li><span>02</span>礦物灰泥・霧面牆體</li><li><span>03</span>回收老檜木・餐桌與層板</li><li><span>04</span>洗石子・室內外地坪</li></ul></section>
    <section class="before-after page-shell-wide"><div><p class="eyebrow">03・BEFORE / AFTER</p><h2>不是翻新，<br />而是重新看見。</h2><p>拆除不必要的隔間後，原本背光的餐廳與院子重新相連。示意區以材質明度區分改造前後，待實景照確認後替換。</p></div><div class="ba-grid"><EditorialImage label="BEFORE / CLOSED PLAN" tone="fog" ratio="4 / 3" /><EditorialImage label="AFTER / OPEN COURTYARD" tone="moss" ratio="4 / 3" /></div></section>
    <nav class="project-next page-shell" aria-label="相鄰作品"><a href={withBase('works/')}><small>返回作品集</small>所有室內設計</a><a href={withBase('works/bamboo-house/')}><small>NEXT PROJECT</small>台北・老公寓改造 →</a></nav>
    <section class="project-cta"><p>你的生活，也值得一處安靜的容器。</p><ButtonLink href="contact/" variant="line">談談你的空間 →</ButtonLink></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
